        "prompt": "写转账测试时，除了两边余额的最终值，还应检查什么？",
        "type": "SHORT_ANSWER",
        "difficulty": "MEDIUM",
        "options": null,
        "answerKey": null,
        "explanation": "检查返回的成功标记、失败后两边余额保持原样，以及边界上的刚好余额、整数上限和连续操作。"
      }
    ],
    "exercise": {
      "title": "重构两个账户的转账",
      "description": "输入两个非负 int 余额 A、B 和操作数 n，随后是 n 对方向和金额。方向 AB 表示 A 转给 B，BA 表示 B 转给 A。金额为有符号 long。仅当金额为正、付款余额足够且收款方结果不超过 Integer.MAX_VALUE 时成功。每行依次输出是否成功、A 余额、B 余额，以空格分隔。",
      "difficulty": "HARD",
      "hint": "在 transferTo 里先检查付款余额和收款上限，通过后再修改两边。",
      "sortOrder": 33,
      "starterCode": [
        "import java.util.Scanner;",
        "",
        "class Account {",
        "    private int balance;",
        "",
        "    Account(int balance) {",
        "        this.balance = balance;",
        "    }",
        "",
        "    int getBalance() {",
        "        return balance;",
        "    }",
        "",
        "    boolean transferTo(Account target, long amount) {",
        "        throw new UnsupportedOperationException(\"请完成方法\");",
        "    }",
        "}",
        "",
        "public class Main {",
        "    public static void main(String[] args) {",
        "        Scanner in = new Scanner(System.in);",
        "        Account a = new Account(in.nextInt());",
        "        Account b = new Account(in.nextInt());",
        "        int operations = in.nextInt();",
        "        for (int i = 0; i < operations; i++) {",
        "            String direction = in.next();",
        "            long amount = in.nextLong();",
        "            boolean accepted = direction.equals(\"AB\") ? a.transferTo(b, amount) : b.transferTo(a, amount);",
        "            System.out.println(accepted + \" \" + a.getBalance() + \" \" + b.getBalance());",
        "        }",
        "    }",
        "}"
      ],
      "solutionBody": [
        "        if (amount <= 0 || amount > balance || amount > Integer.MAX_VALUE - target.balance) {",
        "            return false;",
        "        }",
        "        balance -= (int) amount;",
        "        target.balance += (int) amount;",
        "        return true;"
      ],
