        "explanation": "修改后查找可能使用不同的哈希值或相等条件，导致原条目难以通过该键找到。"
      }
    ],
    "exercise": {
      "title": "按首次出现顺序统计频次",
      "description": "输入 n 和 n 个 int。统计每个不同数字的频次，按首次出现顺序输出，每行格式为 数字:次数。n 为 0 时无输出。",
      "difficulty": "MEDIUM",
      "hint": "用 LinkedHashMap 记录首次插入顺序，用 merge 或 getOrDefault 更新次数。",
      "sortOrder": 34,
      "starterCode": [
        "import java.util.LinkedHashMap;",
        "import java.util.Map;",
        "import java.util.Scanner;",
        "",
        "public class Main {",
        "    static Map<Integer, Integer> frequencies(int[] values) {",
        "        throw new UnsupportedOperationException(\"请完成方法\");",
        "    }",
        "",
        "    public static void main(String[] args) {",
        "        Scanner in = new Scanner(System.in);",
        "        int[] values = new int[in.nextInt()];",
        "        for (int i = 0; i < values.length; i++) {",
        "            values[i] = in.nextInt();",
        "        }",
        "        frequencies(values).forEach((value, count) -> System.out.println(value + \":\" + count));",
        "    }",
        "}"
      ],
      "solutionBody": [
        "        Map<Integer, Integer> counts = new LinkedHashMap<>();",
        "        for (int value : values) {",
        "            counts.merge(value, 1, Integer::sum);",
        "        }",
        "        return counts;"
      ],
      "cases": [
        {
          "name": "频次与输入顺序",
          "stdin": "6\n3 1 3 2 1 3",
          "expected": "3:3\n1:2\n2:1"
        },
        {
          "name": "零与负数",
          "stdin": "4\n0 -2 -2 0",
          "expected": "0:2\n-2:2"
        },
