    "exercise": {
      "title": "区分查询成功、参数错误与资源不存在",
      "description": "已有课程编号为 1、3、5。输入一整行编号字符串，允许首尾空白。有效编号须仅有 ASCII 数字且在 1 到 Integer.MAX_VALUE 之间，允许前导零。无效输出 400；有效但不存在输出 404；存在输出 200。本题只实现状态判断函数。",
      "difficulty": "MEDIUM",
      "hint": "先验证字符形态，再用 Integer.parseInt 判断是否超出上限，最后查询编号是否存在。",
      "sortOrder": 38,
      "starterCode": [
        "import java.util.Scanner;",
        "import java.util.Set;",
        "",
        "public class Main {",
        "    static int status(String raw, Set<Integer> knownIds) {",
        "        throw new UnsupportedOperationException(\"请完成方法\");",
        "    }",
        "",
        "    public static void main(String[] args) {",
        "        Scanner in = new Scanner(System.in);",
        "        String input = in.hasNextLine() ? in.nextLine() : \"\";",
        "        System.out.println(status(input, Set.of(1, 3, 5)));",
        "    }",
        "}"
      ],
      "solutionBody": [
        "        String value = raw.strip();",
        "        if (!value.matches(\"[0-9]+\")) return 400;",
        "        try {",
        "            int id = Integer.parseInt(value);",
        "            if (id == 0) return 400;",
        "            return knownIds.contains(id) ? 200 : 404;",
        "        } catch (NumberFormatException e) {",
        "            return 400;",
        "        }"
      ],
